# Production env — do not hand-copy this file. Generate .env.server with:
#
#   scripts/gen-env-server.sh --app olexfilms.app --realtime wss.olexfilms.app
#
# It starts from .env.example, generates every secret (DB, Redis, SeaweedFS,
# Centrifugo, JWT, Meili, NextAuth, VAPID, wuzapi), wires the internal
# <service>.<prefix>-app URLs and keeps existing values on re-run.
# --rotate renews the secrets; APP_ENCRYPTION_KEY and
# WUZAPI_GLOBAL_ENCRYPTION_KEY are never rotated by it.
#
# Fill by hand afterwards when needed: SMTP_* (or pass --smtp-*),
# WUZAPI_WEBHOOK_URL, MIGRATOR_*_DSN (F2), SA_* (seed).
#
# Then: make prod-config / make prod-up / make prod-create-super-admin
# Create once on the host: docker network create dokploy-network
# Domains and Traefik: docs/deploy.md
